  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "數值分析與微分方程解析",
    "sub_ename": "NUMERICAL ANALYSIS INCLUDING DIFFERENTIAL EQUATIONS",
    "describe_ch": "許多工程與非工程的問題皆可轉化成非線性方程式、聯立方程組、或微分方程式的型式, 然其求解通常無解析解的存在, 故以數值方法求解乃一必備的核心能力。本課程利用程式語言及現成的數學軟體,如EXCEL, STELLA, MATLAB, MATHMATICA, IMSL程式庫等工具來求解非線性方程式、聯立方程組、與微分方程式。學習的過程中可讓學生熟悉個人電腦的多種應用,如繪圖、內差、與趨勢預測等等。",
    "describe_eh": " Employ computer language and existing mathematical software, such as EXCEL, STELLA, MATLAB, MATHMATICA to solve nonlinear equations, sets of equations, and differential equations. In the meantime, students can learn computer skills, such as figure plotting, interpolation, and curve fitting etc.　",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
